<div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" style="" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" data-w="12">
<div id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1679070814639" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module widget-type-rich_text" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><span id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1679070814639_" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="rich_text"><h1 style="font-size: 30px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: normal;">COALITION GREENWICH REPORT<br></span></span><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">Globalization of Algorithmic Equity Trading: A Buy-Side View</span></h1>
<p style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">To achieve the crucial goal of best execution, an increasingly sophisticated and data-driven buy side is now more than ever seeking out sell-side partners that </span><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">match their requirements.</span></p>
<p style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">This study uncovers the similarities and differences in perspectives among buy-side traders in North America, the European </span><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">Union and the United Kingdom concerning:</span></p>
<ul style="font-size: 18px;">
<li><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">Best execution</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">Algo platform and venue selection</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">Strategy discretion</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">Regulatory initiatives</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">Market microstructure</span></li>
</ul></span></div>

</div><!--end widget-span -->
</div><!--end row-->
</div><!--end row-wrapper -->

</div><!--end widget-span -->
<div class="span4 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" style="" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="8" data-w="4">

